	(text "Only PCIe lane 0 is wired (x1). PET = host transmit (CM5 TX, AC caps on the module). PER = host receive: per the M.2 spec the SSD carries its own TX caps, so R502/R503 are 0R; the same 0402 pads take 100n if a module without caps turns up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 276 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5b8c2bde-8f8f-4fac-b9b7-145681059332")
	)
	(text "PEDET (pin 69) is pulled up and read by GPIO19: an M.2 SATA module grounds it, and the software refuses the bay instead of trying PCIe."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 280.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
